    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to present 40 Chanel Avenue to the sales market. This deceptively bright & spacious 3 bedroomed semi-detached residence with accommodation extending to c. 113sq.m has a kitchen extension to rear, garage to side and offers scope to extend subject to planning permission should additional accommodation be required. Situated in this enviable residential location just off Ardlea Road the property is well served by established amenities in the vicinity. The property is further complimented by off street parking, a side entrance and a large rear garden which enjoys a south easterly orientation. Viewing of No. 40 is strongly recommended.\n\nThe house is located just off the Malahide Road in this well established and enviable location. Every conceivable amenity is available on your doorstep choice of schools primary/secondary, choice of bus links, numerous shopping centres and neighbourhood shops. The house is less than 10 minutes drive to Beaumont Hospital and M50/M1 motorway`s and easily accessible for Dublin International Airport, Dollymount Beach and nearby DART station is a mere 15 minute walk from the house.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance - 2.28m (7'6\") x 0.77m (2'6\")\nAluminium sliding door.\n\nReception Hall\nRecessed lighting.\n\nLounge/Dining Room - 7.89m (25'11\") x 3.72m (12'2\")\nTiled fireplace. Aluminium single glazed patio doors.\n\nKitchen/Breakfast Room (L-shaped) - 5.73m (18'10\") x 5.38m (17'8\")\nFitted presses. PVC french doors to rear. Door into garage.\n\nBreakfast Room - 2.58m (8'6\") x 2m (6'7\")\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.98m (13'1\") x 3.07m (10'1\")\nSliderobes. Hotpress.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.65m (12'0\") x 3.03m (9'11\")\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.74m (9'0\") x 2.73m (8'11\")\n\nBathroom\nBath, whb and wc.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> PVC double glazed windows to front </li><li> Gas central heating </li><li> Garage c. 6.41m x 3.13m suitable for conversion subject to P.P </li><li> Off street parking </li><li> South easterly rear orientation </li><li> Side entrance </li><li> Sought after address </li><li> Chain free</li></ul>"
      },
